The project implements a psychological analysis and therapy modeling system through four core components:

## Core Components

### Psychological Evolution Engine (95/100)
Location: backend/app/services/psychology_engine.py
- AI-driven analysis of life experience impacts on personality development
- Trauma impact calculations using developmental psychology principles
- Personality trait evolution and symptom progression modeling
- Attachment style change tracking and analysis

### Therapeutic Intervention Analysis (90/100)
Location: backend/app/services/intervention_engine.py
- Therapy efficacy evaluation based on symptom profiles and age factors
- Treatment outcome modeling for varying therapy durations
- Therapy-symptom match scoring system
- Coping skill development tracking

### Developmental Framework (85/100)
Location: backend/app/utils/developmental_stages.py
- Age-specific developmental stage modeling
- Trauma impact multipliers for different developmental phases
- Stage-appropriate coping capacity definitions
- Therapeutic intervention age mapping

### Evidence-Based Therapy Database (80/100)
Location: backend/app/utils/therapy_database.py
- Comprehensive therapy modality definitions
- Symptom-to-therapy approach mapping
- Intervention selection support system
- Therapy efficacy calculations

## Domain-Specific Features

### Trauma Processing
- Development stage-based impact calculations
- Cross-experience trigger detection
- Personality evolution modeling

### Therapeutic Modeling
- Age-appropriate intervention matching
- Symptom severity analysis
- Treatment outcome predictions
- Therapy efficacy scoring

